If you've a large number of items from which you would like to remove curses,
probably the best way to go is a blessed scroll of remove curse.
Blessed scrolls of remove curse uncurses all the items you are carrying, not
just the ones you are wearing.

Potions of holy water can be created using any Lawful altar.
Just drop a potion of water on top of it.
Now, if you don't have a Lawful altar, you may have a bit of a problem.
There are ways around that, though.

